intro = Braham: "The Molten Alliance's facility. This is where they forge the weapons that will burn Tyria."
intro.rox = Rox: "Four packs between us and the bridge. The last one has a resonator guardian: take it down first."
shielded = The resonator guardian protects it: take the guardian down!
bridge = The pack is defeated: the bridge over the lava channel lowers.
lava = The lava burns you!
lava.out = The lava throws you back to the last checkpoint.
effigy.enter = The Molten Effigy awakens. Its Protector makes it invulnerable, and a resonator guardian protects the Protector: in order!
effigy.protected = The Protector makes the Effigy invulnerable: bring it down first!
effigy.protector = The Protector falls: the Effigy is vulnerable.
effigy.might = The Effigy grows stronger (Might {stacks}).
effigy.shock = The Effigy pounds the ground: jump over the shockwave!
effigy.victory = The Effigy collapses: the foundry door opens.
checkpoint = Checkpoint reached.
groups = Groups defeated: {count}/{total}.
boilers.open = Braham: "The crucible bridge is open. Both bosses are waiting below."
duo.enter = The Molten Berserker and Firestorm! When one loses a quarter of its health, the other becomes enraged. Bring the Firestorm down first.
duo.ground = The Berserker smashes the ground: WHITE wave, jump over it!
duo.air = The Berserker strikes the air: BLUE wave, stay on the ground!
duo.enraged = {name} becomes enraged!
duo.upgrade = {name} absorbs its ally's flame and grows stronger!
duo.debris = Debris is falling!
duo.wind = The Firestorm raises a scorching wind at the platform's edge: move away from the edge!
duo.victory = The foundry goes cold. Rox: "No forge, no weapons." The treasure is yours.
title.victory = Molten Boss complete
